### Test Paiement Service - Initier Paiement
### Prérequis: Vous devez avoir un token CLIENT valide et un UUID de client et trip

### 1. Login pour obtenir un token CLIENT
POST http://localhost:8080/auth-service/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmed@gmail.com",
  "password": "ahmed123"
}

### 2. Initier un paiement pour un ticket (avec token)
### Remplacez {CLIENT_TOKEN}, {CLIENT_ID}, et {TRIP_ID} par les valeurs réelles
POST http://localhost:8082/paiements/initier
Authorization: Bearer {CLIENT_TOKEN}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "{CLIENT_ID}",
  "montant": 7.00,
  "typePaiement": "CARTE_BANCAIRE",
  "typeService": "ACHAT_TICKET",
  "referenceService": "{TRIP_ID}",
  "description": "Achat ticket de bus",
  "infoCarte": {
    "numeroCarte": "4532123456789012",
    "nomTitulaire": "AHMED AHMED",
    "dateExpiration": "12/26",
    "cvv": "123"
  }
}

### 3. Test avec curl (copier-coller dans le terminal)
### curl -X POST http://localhost:8082/paiements/initier \
###   -H "Authorization: Bearer {CLIENT_TOKEN}" \
###   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
###   -d '{
###     "clientId": "{CLIENT_ID}",
###     "montant": 7.00,
###     "typePaiement": "CARTE_BANCAIRE",
###     "typeService": "ACHAT_TICKET",
###     "referenceService": "{TRIP_ID}",
###     "description": "Achat ticket de bus",
###     "infoCarte": {
###       "numeroCarte": "4532123456789012",
###       "nomTitulaire": "AHMED AHMED",
###       "dateExpiration": "12/26",
###       "cvv": "123"
###     }
###   }'

